WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.201
Masacɛ ma sɔn.

00:00:01.281 --> 00:00:06.600
Loon dɔ sufɛ, Yennenga y'a ka soo datugu ka bɔ masaso kɔnɔ.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:10.627
A yɛlɛnna ka taga sahiliyanfan na wagatijan.

00:00:10.707 --> 00:00:17.399
A ka bajiw tigɛ, fɔ ka taga a ta so baraka ban, ka taga lɔ yiritu dɔ kɔnɔ.
